'''Doge''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
Its blade is tan in color with the face of Doge imprinted on it by the tip, hence the name. The guard is brown, and the handle is solid black with quotes that use the colors of the rainbow imprinted on it.
==Trivia==

* It has a [[Doge (Effect)|partner effect]] under the same name, and a partner pet under the name [[Dogey]].
*It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/2032622/profile/ CloneTrooper1019].
*This knife, along with many other knives, are from other Murder games. ''For example: Murder by CloneTrooper1019.''
*The description of this knife is: "wow. much death. dreams of cheese. many murder. very blood."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/159758511/SKIN-Doge-Knife Model created by CloneTrooper1019]</ref>. These quotes can also be found on the handle of the knife.

